@api = http://localhost:5080

### Login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@axpense.local", "password": "Admin12345!" }

### Submit a lead (public)
POST {{api}}/api/public/leads
Content-Type: application/json

